{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"You are formless, and two massive white ravens stand upon a pile of floating rocks.","created_at":"2021-07-19T04:01:58.702000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866530282500128768","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"Seraxa?\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T04:02:12.607000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866530340821794906","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"Hundreds of years and this is the first time I've died.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T04:02:31.872000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-19T04:03:05.081000Z","id":"866530421624930314","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"So thats what this is.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T04:02:49.208000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866530494338433024","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"I will never be able to thank you enough, Seraxa.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T04:03:32.390000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866530675455950868","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"Evelyn. What season were you?\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T04:04:01.891000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866530799191588905","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"Winter.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T04:04:09.271000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866530830146600990","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"A frost encases you. You feel new life grow around you until your old self becomes whole once again.","created_at":"2021-07-19T04:04:46.956000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866530988209078303","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"(wooooo)","created_at":"2021-07-19T04:04:55.374000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866531023515811850","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"Pact Keeper. Name your race.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T04:05:07.975000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866531076369022996","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"I... I was a sea elf once.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T04:05:21.113000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866531131472740382","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"The smell of salt water fills your essence. The roar of the wave. The pull of the tide. Your body form it's blue hued skin. Your old self becomes whole once again.","created_at":"2021-07-19T04:06:51.700000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866531511422812170","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"Two elves. Two ravens. A priestess of Huginn (of Thought) and a priestess of Muninn (of Memory). Minister to the Empire of Refuge, that it might not consume itself under the duress of this war.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T04:08:43.604000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-19T04:08:57.428000Z","id":"866531980781944832","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"We'll take care of this city.\" The sea elf promises.","created_at":"2021-07-19T04:09:38.556000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866532211267207200","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"We will.\" The Eladrin bows.","created_at":"2021-07-19T04:09:57.894000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866532292377706526","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"Irnix\" Huginn speaks to claim you.\n\"Willow\" Muninn speaks to claim you.","created_at":"2021-07-19T04:10:30.430000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-19T04:11:09.590000Z","id":"866532428842795009","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
