{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"(and Irinx for me)","created_at":"2021-07-19T04:10:54.453000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866532529602035723","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"The lower a wing each to carry you back to Empire.","created_at":"2021-07-19T04:11:41.606000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-19T04:11:53.341000Z","id":"866532727376576543","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"<@!366565198284324868> the ravens await","created_at":"2021-07-21T05:48:54.366000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867281967476375562","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"Back so soon?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T05:49:46.753000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867282187203903539","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"Irynx flits over from her perch in Murry Hill park.","created_at":"2021-07-21T05:50:08.216000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867282277226119178","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"The city has a habit of doing this, I find.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T05:50:25.738000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867282350718844928","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"Loosing a coin is an accident. Loosing this many lives feels... careless.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T05:50:52.089000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867282461242294322","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"But my friends live, at least. I am the only lost soul of the night.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T05:52:05.192000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867282767859023882","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"Lost. Found. It ought to make more difference than this. We encourage you... to keep others from being less. Wasteful. The more you die. The less of you remains. Refilling a body is like pouring water from one cup into another at a very high distance. Not all of the water makes it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T05:53:55.266000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867283229542580235","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"I've always tried to keep living. It's a lot of effort to do it for the others, especially when everyone knows that Empire City has a gravity that keeps the dead.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T05:57:39.732000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867284171022139403","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"Empire must not fall. The Old world would over run Arcania. The cycle of life and death is necessary, but it is also poison.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:01:46.702000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T06:03:05.237000Z","id":"867285206889005057","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"You must grow stronger.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:03:22.201000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867285607440187413","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"Maybe others should be stronger too. I gave my friend everything I carried and he barely lived.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:05:25.848000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T06:09:43.483000Z","id":"867286126053031976","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852144266625155072","content":"\"Others did not agree to protect the people of Empire on our behalf.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:05:52.672000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867286238561697822","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
